{"schema":"ld-s10y-lesson/source-author-FIRST@1","stage":"authored-and-composed-before-any-finalize","createdAt":"2026-11-22T14:42:28.222Z","cwd":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck","book":"8a","lesson":"alg8-c4-s2-n26","status":"SOURCE_REVIEW_PENDING","imageBatch":{"batches":1,"viewImageCalls":6,"order":[160,161,162,163,164,165],"reopens":0,"additionalCropViews":0},"boundary159ReadOnly":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N25-raw/8a/pages/0159/page.json","bytes":5433,"sha256":"9c8cef9e31dd43c9a0d0415163b21502a041615a1b04be1a8eccd4caeba6ef5a"},"nextBoundary":{"physicalPage":165,"printedPage":158,"lesson":"alg8-c4-s3-n27","publish":false},"observations":[{"page":160,"printedPage":153,"observedLines":25,"breakdown":"24 text/formula rows + 1 footer","exerciseObjects":[],"figureBoxes":[],"continuation":"First p cont completes the open p from physical 159; final p open continues to 161.","notes":["N26 continuation from physical 159; no source-159 artifact was edited."]},{"page":161,"printedPage":154,"observedLines":25,"breakdown":"23 prose/formula rows + 1 exercise-heading row + 1 footer","exerciseObjects":[{"number":"478","open":true,"printedHere":"heading only"}],"figureBoxes":[],"continuation":"First p cont completes physical 160; exercise 478 open continues to 162.","notes":["First-view source uncertainty: in p0161#13, the 3 on the right-hand sixth root appears below the 2 baseline, encoded as 2_3. Adjacent equations retain their printed 2^3. Independent source review is required; no mathematical erratum or correction was registered."]},{"page":162,"printedPage":155,"observedLines":22,"breakdown":"478 continuation 3 + 479 4 + 480 5 + 481 3 + 482 2 + 483 3 + 484 heading 1 + footer 1","exerciseObjects":[{"number":"478","cont":true,"subparts":8},{"number":"479","subparts":8},{"number":"480","subparts":8},{"number":"481","subparts":5},{"number":"482","subparts":4},{"number":"483","subparts":5},{"number":"484","open":true,"printedHere":"heading only"}],"figureBoxes":[],"continuation":"478 cont closes the preceding heading; 484 open continues to 163.","notes":["Horizontal subparts share printed rows; tall fractions do not add labelrow or invented wrap markers."]},{"page":163,"printedPage":156,"observedLines":21,"breakdown":"484 continuation 3 + 485 3 + 486 4 + 487 4 + 488 4 + 489 2 + footer 1","exerciseObjects":[{"number":"484","cont":true,"subparts":8},{"number":"485","subparts":8},{"number":"486","subparts":8},{"number":"487","subparts":6},{"number":"488","subparts":9},{"number":"489","subparts":4}],"figureBoxes":[],"continuation":"484 cont closes the preceding heading; 485-489 are complete on this page.","notes":["Nested radicals, Cyrillic subparts, and printed fraction rows are retained without mathematical revision."]},{"page":164,"printedPage":157,"observedLines":25,"breakdown":"490 4 + 491 4 + 492 3 + 493 4 + review heading 1 + 494 4 + 495 2 + 496 2 + footer 1","exerciseObjects":[{"number":"490","subparts":8},{"number":"491","subparts":6},{"number":"492","subparts":4},{"number":"493","subparts":4},{"number":"494","group":"复习题"},{"number":"495","group":"复习题"},{"number":"496","group":"复习题"}],"figureBoxes":[],"continuation":"490-496 are complete; review group starts before 494.","notes":["Exercise 493 retains the different printed radical indices of its factors; no mathematical correction was made."]},{"page":165,"printedPage":158,"observedLines":20,"breakdown":"497 2 + section/topic headings 2 + initial N27 paragraphs 4 + case-1 paragraph 3 + post-table paragraph 4 + case-2 paragraph 4 + caption 1 - shared caption row 1 + footer 1; figure/table interiors excluded","exerciseObjects":[{"number":"497","group":"复习题"}],"figureBoxes":[{"label":"表","box":[280,1840,1750,285],"scope":"N27 prose","inventory":{"rows":2,"columns":10,"x":[-4,-3,-2,-1,0,1,2,3,4],"y":["0.32","0.42","0.56","0.75","1.00","1.33","1.78","2.37","3.16"]}},{"label":"图 65","box":[1190,2160,800,835],"scope":"N27 prose","inventory":{"description":"Ruled coordinate plane with nine isolated plotted points from the table; not a continuous curve.","labels":["x","y","-4","-3","-2","-1","O","1","2","3","4","5"],"caption":"图 65","captionSharesLastProseRow":true}}],"continuation":"497 completes N26 before h2 §10 and h3 27; final N27 p is open and ends in 保. No N27 publication is authorized.","notes":["N26 ends with exercise 497; everything after the section/topic headings belongs to the incomplete N27 boundary, not to N26.","The unnumbered table and figure 65 are N27 prose figures. Table/figure interior print is retained by figure boxes; the printed caption is a separate samerow block.","The case-2 a = 2/3 formula wraps after a in the source; one actual wrap marker preserves the two printed rows."]}],"observedTotalLinesIncludingFooters":138,"expectedN26Exercises":{"first":478,"last":497,"count":20,"main":"478-493","review":"494-497"},"beforeFinalize":[{"page":160,"template":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26/8a/pages/0160/page.template.md","bytes":1454,"sha256":"8782be6e3c976f38ed07c07eb6e5fe0054971e6b98946cefa5e1157ac00fce6a"},"sourcePagePng":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26/8a/pages/0160/page.png","bytes":995696,"sha256":"abe1aa782c18751a053f639723b95c19954610245f6b47b12aeb8ae77f12717b"},"sourceGridPng":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26/8a/pages/0160/page.grid.png","bytes":1003667,"sha256":"94d1a6d7e357b3367fa3325c42775418d9497442ae910b47fb5713ed4ffd2faa"},"body":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26-bodies/0160.md","bytes":1790,"sha256":"d15d49df757d8afd2dc1c68b50db4d51e6bcb0cd10077586ff3241f35ff1dda4","utf8":"<!-- p cont -->\n$(\\sqrt[n]{a}\\cdot\\sqrt[n]{b})^n=(\\sqrt[n]{a})^n\\cdot(\\sqrt[n]{b})^n=ab$。\n\n<!-- p -->\n所以，根据 $n$ 次算术根的定义，等式 $\\sqrt[n]{ab}=\\sqrt[n]{a}\\cdot\\sqrt[n]{b}$\n$(a\\geqslant0,b\\geqslant0)$ 是真等式。\n\n<!-- p -->\n因此，当 $n$ 是任何自然数时，两个非负因数的积的 $n$ 次算\n术根等于这两个因数的 $n$ 次算术根的积。\n\n<!-- p -->\n通过类似的讨论，可以证明 $n$ 次算术根的第二个性质（定\n理 $2$）：当 $n$ 是任何自然数时，分子是非负数而分母是正数的\n分数的 $n$ 次算术根等于分子的 $n$ 次算术根除以分母的 $n$ 次算\n术根。\n\n<!-- p -->\n我们举出应用这两个定理的例子。\n\n<!-- p -->\n例 $1$ 求式 $\\sqrt[4]{16\\times81}$ 的值。\n\n<!-- p -->\n根据定理 $1$ 得：$\\sqrt[4]{16\\times81}=\\sqrt[4]{16}\\times\\sqrt[4]{81}=2\\times3=6$。\n\n<!-- p -->\n例 $2$ 化简 $\\sqrt[3]{2}\\times\\sqrt[3]{4}$。\n\n<!-- p -->\n我们写出等式 $\\sqrt[n]{ab}=\\sqrt[n]{a}\\cdot\\sqrt[n]{b}$（$a\\geqslant0,b\\geqslant0$），\n或写成另一形式：$\\sqrt[n]{a}\\cdot\\sqrt[n]{b}=\\sqrt[n]{ab}$。利用这个等式，得到：\n$\\sqrt[3]{2}\\times\\sqrt[3]{4}=\\sqrt[3]{2\\times4}=\\sqrt[3]{8}=2$。\n\n<!-- p -->\n例 $3$ 求式 $\\sqrt[3]{2\\frac{10}{27}}$ 的值。\n\n<!-- p -->\n根据定理 $2$，得\n$\\sqrt[3]{2\\frac{10}{27}}=\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{64}{27}}=\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{64}}{\\sqrt[3]{27}}=\\frac{4}{3}=1\\frac{1}{3}$。\n\n<!-- p -->\n现在，我们讨论 $n$ 次算术根的其他性质。我们从例子\n着手。\n\n<!-- p -->\n假设需要比较根式 $\\sqrt{\\sqrt[3]{64}}$ 和 $\\sqrt[6]{64}$ 的值的大小。\n$\\sqrt{\\sqrt[3]{64}}=\\sqrt{4}=2$，　　$\\sqrt[6]{64}=\\sqrt[6]{2^6}=2$。\n\n<!-- p open -->\n我们看到，这两个式子的值相等，也就是，\n\n<!-- foot -->\n153\n"},"beforeFinalize":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26-raw/8a/pages/0160/page.md","bytes":2471,"sha256":"c9a2a34578ff5586661d5982d7c45de59c39f360e3d052992e1b9a5619297026","utf8":"---\n{\n  \"schema\": \"ld-s10y-lesson/page@3\",\n  \"book\": \"8a\",\n  \"page\": 160,\n  \"printed_page\": 153,\n  \"source\": {\n    \"pdf\": \"8a 苏联十年制学校数学教材 代数 八年级.pdf\",\n    \"pdf_sha256\": \"5978388efc80df4085400f80d5912f710efb052a806222633b172b0a9479b071\",\n    \"pdf_page\": 160\n  },\n  \"render\": {\n    \"dpi\": 300,\n    \"w\": 2480,\n    \"h\": 3509,\n    \"sha256\": \"abe1aa782c18751a053f639723b95c19954610245f6b47b12aeb8ae77f12717b\"\n  },\n  \"profile\": {\n    \"id\": \"soviet-cn\",\n    \"sha256\": \"dad8d974ba16880482f359073263269de8c405ccf8cb17dc4215fad11da44849\"\n  },\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"N26 continuation from physical 159; no source-159 artifact was edited.\"\n  ],\n  \"errata\": []\n}\n---\n\n<!-- p cont -->\n$(\\sqrt[n]{a}\\cdot\\sqrt[n]{b})^n=(\\sqrt[n]{a})^n\\cdot(\\sqrt[n]{b})^n=ab$。\n\n<!-- p -->\n所以，根据 $n$ 次算术根的定义，等式 $\\sqrt[n]{ab}=\\sqrt[n]{a}\\cdot\\sqrt[n]{b}$\n$(a\\geqslant0,b\\geqslant0)$ 是真等式。\n\n<!-- p -->\n因此，当 $n$ 是任何自然数时，两个非负因数的积的 $n$ 次算\n术根等于这两个因数的 $n$ 次算术根的积。\n\n<!-- p -->\n通过类似的讨论，可以证明 $n$ 次算术根的第二个性质（定\n理 $2$）：当 $n$ 是任何自然数时，分子是非负数而分母是正数的\n分数的 $n$ 次算术根等于分子的 $n$ 次算术根除以分母的 $n$ 次算\n术根。\n\n<!-- p -->\n我们举出应用这两个定理的例子。\n\n<!-- p -->\n例 $1$ 求式 $\\sqrt[4]{16\\times81}$ 的值。\n\n<!-- p -->\n根据定理 $1$ 得：$\\sqrt[4]{16\\times81}=\\sqrt[4]{16}\\times\\sqrt[4]{81}=2\\times3=6$。\n\n<!-- p -->\n例 $2$ 化简 $\\sqrt[3]{2}\\times\\sqrt[3]{4}$。\n\n<!-- p -->\n我们写出等式 $\\sqrt[n]{ab}=\\sqrt[n]{a}\\cdot\\sqrt[n]{b}$（$a\\geqslant0,b\\geqslant0$），\n或写成另一形式：$\\sqrt[n]{a}\\cdot\\sqrt[n]{b}=\\sqrt[n]{ab}$。利用这个等式，得到：\n$\\sqrt[3]{2}\\times\\sqrt[3]{4}=\\sqrt[3]{2\\times4}=\\sqrt[3]{8}=2$。\n\n<!-- p -->\n例 $3$ 求式 $\\sqrt[3]{2\\frac{10}{27}}$ 的值。\n\n<!-- p -->\n根据定理 $2$，得\n$\\sqrt[3]{2\\frac{10}{27}}=\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{64}{27}}=\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{64}}{\\sqrt[3]{27}}=\\frac{4}{3}=1\\frac{1}{3}$。\n\n<!-- p -->\n现在，我们讨论 $n$ 次算术根的其他性质。我们从例子\n着手。\n\n<!-- p -->\n假设需要比较根式 $\\sqrt{\\sqrt[3]{64}}$ 和 $\\sqrt[6]{64}$ 的值的大小。\n$\\sqrt{\\sqrt[3]{64}}=\\sqrt{4}=2$，　　$\\sqrt[6]{64}=\\sqrt[6]{2^6}=2$。\n\n<!-- p open -->\n我们看到，这两个式子的值相等，也就是，\n\n<!-- foot -->\n153\n"}},{"page":161,"template":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26/8a/pages/0161/page.template.md","bytes":1454,"sha256":"3660e7e2ba2da7fc27b181d91bb22d8ebe90cfcb1ac9257af1e3951eebe1fb74"},"sourcePagePng":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26/8a/pages/0161/page.png","bytes":831893,"sha256":"361e936fbeb3da2e1f1d1e4a29e18fe276a1cb6d5f25dc2ef57bd4f8802a4ec2"},"sourceGridPng":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26/8a/pages/0161/page.grid.png","bytes":837278,"sha256":"752d3e785b2abb4a49cc643bce44d1532bafc7b65673b2e243bcc571b393c11c"},"body":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26-bodies/0161.md","bytes":1593,"sha256":"391b3b5fa29d613fc644a22c473449f6877365d3cf8dfa01f04001c1601f8823","utf8":"<!-- p cont -->\n$\\sqrt{\\sqrt[3]{64}}=\\sqrt[6]{64}$。\n\n<!-- p -->\n定理 $3$ 如果 $a\\geqslant0$，那么 $\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{a}}=\\sqrt[nk]{a}$（$n$ 和 $k$ 是自然数）。\n\n<!-- p -->\n式 $\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{a}}$ 的值是非负的。此外，式 $\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{a}}$ 的 $nk$ 次幂等\n于 $a$。\n\n<!-- p -->\n实际上：\n$(\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{a}})^{nk}=((\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{a}})^n)^k=(\\sqrt[k]{a})^k=a$。\n\n<!-- p -->\n于是，根据 $n$ 次算术根的定义，等式 $\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{a}}=\\sqrt[nk]{a}$（$a\\geqslant0$）\n是真等式。\n\n<!-- p -->\n定理 $4$ 如果 $a\\geqslant0$，那么 $\\sqrt[nk]{a^{mk}}=\\sqrt[n]{a^m}$（$n$，$k$ 和 $m$ 是自\n然数）。\n\n<!-- p -->\n根据定理 $3$ 得到：\n$\\sqrt[nk]{a^{mk}}=\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{a^{mk}}}=\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{(a^m)^k}}=\\sqrt[n]{a^m}$。\n\n<!-- p -->\n我们已经证明，如果根指数和被开方式的幂指数同乘以\n或者同除以同一个自然数，那么根式的值不变。\n\n<!-- p -->\n有时，我们把根式的这个性质叫做根式的基本性质（和分\n式的基本性质类似）。\n\n<!-- p -->\n我们举一个应用定理 $3$ 和定理 $4$ 的例子。\n\n<!-- p -->\n化简 $\\sqrt[3]{2\\sqrt{2}}$。\n\n<!-- p -->\n把因数 $2$ 移到平方根号下面，得到：\n$\\sqrt[3]{2\\sqrt{2}}=\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt{2^2\\times2}}=\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt{2^3}}$。\n\n<!-- p -->\n根据定理 $3$，得：$\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt{2^3}}=\\sqrt[6]{2_3}$。\n\n<!-- p -->\n应用定理 $4$，得：$\\sqrt[6]{2^3}=\\sqrt{2}$。\n\n<!-- p -->\n因此，$\\sqrt[3]{2\\sqrt{2}}=\\sqrt{2}$。\n\n<!-- ex 478 open -->\n478. 求下列各式的值：\n\n<!-- foot -->\n154\n"},"beforeFinalize":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26-raw/8a/pages/0161/page.md","bytes":2466,"sha256":"528a3a1280b3ecedcebadafbd60cbfd231dc9ca54b8a4588aa3f5ccb954bfa19","utf8":"---\n{\n  \"schema\": \"ld-s10y-lesson/page@3\",\n  \"book\": \"8a\",\n  \"page\": 161,\n  \"printed_page\": 154,\n  \"source\": {\n    \"pdf\": \"8a 苏联十年制学校数学教材 代数 八年级.pdf\",\n    \"pdf_sha256\": \"5978388efc80df4085400f80d5912f710efb052a806222633b172b0a9479b071\",\n    \"pdf_page\": 161\n  },\n  \"render\": {\n    \"dpi\": 300,\n    \"w\": 2480,\n    \"h\": 3509,\n    \"sha256\": \"361e936fbeb3da2e1f1d1e4a29e18fe276a1cb6d5f25dc2ef57bd4f8802a4ec2\"\n  },\n  \"profile\": {\n    \"id\": \"soviet-cn\",\n    \"sha256\": \"dad8d974ba16880482f359073263269de8c405ccf8cb17dc4215fad11da44849\"\n  },\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"First-view source uncertainty: in p0161#13, the 3 on the right-hand sixth root appears below the 2 baseline, encoded as 2_3. Adjacent equations retain their printed 2^3. Independent source review is required; no mathematical erratum or correction was registered.\"\n  ],\n  \"errata\": []\n}\n---\n\n<!-- p cont -->\n$\\sqrt{\\sqrt[3]{64}}=\\sqrt[6]{64}$。\n\n<!-- p -->\n定理 $3$ 如果 $a\\geqslant0$，那么 $\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{a}}=\\sqrt[nk]{a}$（$n$ 和 $k$ 是自然数）。\n\n<!-- p -->\n式 $\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{a}}$ 的值是非负的。此外，式 $\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{a}}$ 的 $nk$ 次幂等\n于 $a$。\n\n<!-- p -->\n实际上：\n$(\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{a}})^{nk}=((\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{a}})^n)^k=(\\sqrt[k]{a})^k=a$。\n\n<!-- p -->\n于是，根据 $n$ 次算术根的定义，等式 $\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{a}}=\\sqrt[nk]{a}$（$a\\geqslant0$）\n是真等式。\n\n<!-- p -->\n定理 $4$ 如果 $a\\geqslant0$，那么 $\\sqrt[nk]{a^{mk}}=\\sqrt[n]{a^m}$（$n$，$k$ 和 $m$ 是自\n然数）。\n\n<!-- p -->\n根据定理 $3$ 得到：\n$\\sqrt[nk]{a^{mk}}=\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{a^{mk}}}=\\sqrt[n]{\\sqrt[k]{(a^m)^k}}=\\sqrt[n]{a^m}$。\n\n<!-- p -->\n我们已经证明，如果根指数和被开方式的幂指数同乘以\n或者同除以同一个自然数，那么根式的值不变。\n\n<!-- p -->\n有时，我们把根式的这个性质叫做根式的基本性质（和分\n式的基本性质类似）。\n\n<!-- p -->\n我们举一个应用定理 $3$ 和定理 $4$ 的例子。\n\n<!-- p -->\n化简 $\\sqrt[3]{2\\sqrt{2}}$。\n\n<!-- p -->\n把因数 $2$ 移到平方根号下面，得到：\n$\\sqrt[3]{2\\sqrt{2}}=\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt{2^2\\times2}}=\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt{2^3}}$。\n\n<!-- p -->\n根据定理 $3$，得：$\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt{2^3}}=\\sqrt[6]{2_3}$。\n\n<!-- p -->\n应用定理 $4$，得：$\\sqrt[6]{2^3}=\\sqrt{2}$。\n\n<!-- p -->\n因此，$\\sqrt[3]{2\\sqrt{2}}=\\sqrt{2}$。\n\n<!-- ex 478 open -->\n478. 求下列各式的值：\n\n<!-- foot -->\n154\n"}},{"page":162,"template":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26/8a/pages/0162/page.template.md","bytes":1454,"sha256":"3786f758c2ea94f5d3a970151e6cd0ba99d33de682e992dddc84046ed5b97f3a"},"sourcePagePng":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26/8a/pages/0162/page.png","bytes":730748,"sha256":"4cb20718817a8151300e8bd660ad7a03939b4936dd8b3baa8bac513733b2fa61"},"sourceGridPng":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26/8a/pages/0162/page.grid.png","bytes":738480,"sha256":"6a516c6dda76a08aef11d75cb054642492187e2e002dcb85bf5ed1eecea9f0e4"},"body":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26-bodies/0162.md","bytes":1826,"sha256":"2e2ac6215a653710eba2939ad65c88a476b8a53ceff71ac6c647024f83265fbd","utf8":"<!-- ex 478 cont -->\nа) $\\sqrt[3]{8\\times27}$；　б) $\\sqrt[3]{125\\times27}$；　в) $\\sqrt[4]{16\\times81}$；\nг) $\\sqrt[4]{625\\times16}$；　д) $\\sqrt[3]{0.001\\times125}$； е) $\\sqrt[4]{0.0016\\times81}$；\nж) $\\sqrt[5]{243\\times\\frac{1}{32}}$；　з) $\\sqrt[4]{\\frac{1}{81}\\times10000}$。\n\n<!-- ex 479 -->\n479. 计算：\nа) $\\sqrt[4]{7^4\\times2^4}$；　б) $\\sqrt[5]{6^5\\times3^5}$；　в) $\\sqrt[3]{2^6\\times3^{12}}$；\nг) $\\sqrt[5]{3^{10}\\times0.5^{15}}$；　д) $\\sqrt[3]{24\\times9}$；　е) $\\sqrt[3]{75\\times45}$；\nж) $\\sqrt[4]{54\\times24}$；　з) $\\sqrt[4]{3\\frac{3}{8}\\times1\\frac{1}{2}}$。\n\n<!-- ex 480 -->\n480. 求下列各积的值：\nа) $\\sqrt{20}\\cdot\\sqrt{5}$；　б) $\\sqrt[3]{100}\\cdot\\sqrt[3]{10}$；　в) $\\sqrt[4]{8\\times3}\\cdot\\sqrt[4]{2\\times27}$；\nг) $\\sqrt[4]{25\\times2}\\cdot\\sqrt[4]{25\\times8}$；　　д) $\\sqrt[5]{3^2\\times5^3}\\cdot\\sqrt[5]{3^3\\times5^2}$；\nе) $\\sqrt[6]{7^4\\times2^3}\\cdot\\sqrt[6]{7^2\\times2^3}$；　ж) $\\sqrt[3]{9+\\sqrt{17}}\\cdot\\sqrt[3]{9-\\sqrt{17}}$；\nз) $\\sqrt[4]{10-\\sqrt{19}}\\cdot\\sqrt[4]{10+\\sqrt{19}}$。\n\n<!-- ex 481 -->\n481. 求下列根式的值：\nа) $\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{8}{125}}$；　б) $\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{3^6}{5^3}}$；　в) $\\sqrt[4]{\\frac{2^4}{7^8}}$；　г) $\\sqrt[3]{3\\frac{3}{8}}$；\nд) $\\sqrt[4]{3\\frac{13}{81}}$。\n\n<!-- ex 482 -->\n482. 求下列分式的值：\nа) $\\frac{\\sqrt{8}}{\\sqrt{2}}$；　б) $\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{54}}{\\sqrt[3]{2}}$；　в) $\\frac{\\sqrt[4]{3}}{\\sqrt[4]{48}}$；　г) $\\frac{\\sqrt[5]{5}}{\\sqrt[5]{500000}}$。\n\n<!-- ex 483 -->\n483. 已知字母表示非负数，把下列各式写成单项式：\nа) $\\sqrt{25a^2}$；　б) $\\sqrt[3]{8b^3}$；　в) $\\sqrt[4]{81c^4}$；　г) $\\sqrt[5]{32x^{10}}$；\nд) $\\sqrt[3]{8x^{12}}$。\n\n<!-- ex 484 open -->\n484. 把下列各式写成分式：\n\n<!-- foot -->\n155\n"},"beforeFinalize":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26-raw/8a/pages/0162/page.md","bytes":2537,"sha256":"1739511f7c09a3c4876c00906afb16b9d05d5950c2dc6c2c3774c1fda4686d9b","utf8":"---\n{\n  \"schema\": \"ld-s10y-lesson/page@3\",\n  \"book\": \"8a\",\n  \"page\": 162,\n  \"printed_page\": 155,\n  \"source\": {\n    \"pdf\": \"8a 苏联十年制学校数学教材 代数 八年级.pdf\",\n    \"pdf_sha256\": \"5978388efc80df4085400f80d5912f710efb052a806222633b172b0a9479b071\",\n    \"pdf_page\": 162\n  },\n  \"render\": {\n    \"dpi\": 300,\n    \"w\": 2480,\n    \"h\": 3509,\n    \"sha256\": \"4cb20718817a8151300e8bd660ad7a03939b4936dd8b3baa8bac513733b2fa61\"\n  },\n  \"profile\": {\n    \"id\": \"soviet-cn\",\n    \"sha256\": \"dad8d974ba16880482f359073263269de8c405ccf8cb17dc4215fad11da44849\"\n  },\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"Horizontal subparts share printed rows; tall fractions do not add labelrow or invented wrap markers.\"\n  ],\n  \"errata\": []\n}\n---\n\n<!-- ex 478 cont -->\nа) $\\sqrt[3]{8\\times27}$；　б) $\\sqrt[3]{125\\times27}$；　в) $\\sqrt[4]{16\\times81}$；\nг) $\\sqrt[4]{625\\times16}$；　д) $\\sqrt[3]{0.001\\times125}$； е) $\\sqrt[4]{0.0016\\times81}$；\nж) $\\sqrt[5]{243\\times\\frac{1}{32}}$；　з) $\\sqrt[4]{\\frac{1}{81}\\times10000}$。\n\n<!-- ex 479 -->\n479. 计算：\nа) $\\sqrt[4]{7^4\\times2^4}$；　б) $\\sqrt[5]{6^5\\times3^5}$；　в) $\\sqrt[3]{2^6\\times3^{12}}$；\nг) $\\sqrt[5]{3^{10}\\times0.5^{15}}$；　д) $\\sqrt[3]{24\\times9}$；　е) $\\sqrt[3]{75\\times45}$；\nж) $\\sqrt[4]{54\\times24}$；　з) $\\sqrt[4]{3\\frac{3}{8}\\times1\\frac{1}{2}}$。\n\n<!-- ex 480 -->\n480. 求下列各积的值：\nа) $\\sqrt{20}\\cdot\\sqrt{5}$；　б) $\\sqrt[3]{100}\\cdot\\sqrt[3]{10}$；　в) $\\sqrt[4]{8\\times3}\\cdot\\sqrt[4]{2\\times27}$；\nг) $\\sqrt[4]{25\\times2}\\cdot\\sqrt[4]{25\\times8}$；　　д) $\\sqrt[5]{3^2\\times5^3}\\cdot\\sqrt[5]{3^3\\times5^2}$；\nе) $\\sqrt[6]{7^4\\times2^3}\\cdot\\sqrt[6]{7^2\\times2^3}$；　ж) $\\sqrt[3]{9+\\sqrt{17}}\\cdot\\sqrt[3]{9-\\sqrt{17}}$；\nз) $\\sqrt[4]{10-\\sqrt{19}}\\cdot\\sqrt[4]{10+\\sqrt{19}}$。\n\n<!-- ex 481 -->\n481. 求下列根式的值：\nа) $\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{8}{125}}$；　б) $\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{3^6}{5^3}}$；　в) $\\sqrt[4]{\\frac{2^4}{7^8}}$；　г) $\\sqrt[3]{3\\frac{3}{8}}$；\nд) $\\sqrt[4]{3\\frac{13}{81}}$。\n\n<!-- ex 482 -->\n482. 求下列分式的值：\nа) $\\frac{\\sqrt{8}}{\\sqrt{2}}$；　б) $\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{54}}{\\sqrt[3]{2}}$；　в) $\\frac{\\sqrt[4]{3}}{\\sqrt[4]{48}}$；　г) $\\frac{\\sqrt[5]{5}}{\\sqrt[5]{500000}}$。\n\n<!-- ex 483 -->\n483. 已知字母表示非负数，把下列各式写成单项式：\nа) $\\sqrt{25a^2}$；　б) $\\sqrt[3]{8b^3}$；　в) $\\sqrt[4]{81c^4}$；　г) $\\sqrt[5]{32x^{10}}$；\nд) $\\sqrt[3]{8x^{12}}$。\n\n<!-- ex 484 open -->\n484. 把下列各式写成分式：\n\n<!-- foot -->\n155\n"}},{"page":163,"template":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26/8a/pages/0163/page.template.md","bytes":1454,"sha256":"da402baafd57014d719a447508e294ca260cdfaa4c1e2da483469e7175b6ee85"},"sourcePagePng":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26/8a/pages/0163/page.png","bytes":722112,"sha256":"0357daed5cf73097af3edee9ec653be7625b7cc688dcde7e5ff41e598160b525"},"sourceGridPng":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26/8a/pages/0163/page.grid.png","bytes":729338,"sha256":"f098d8978fb0a6be06974d6c49935a8c0af6e37c89329660ecd300788c2862ba"},"body":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26-bodies/0163.md","bytes":1767,"sha256":"87d43b9fde5616e30a8a8e0bf8a655614bcb1159c84586f535443fbceb39d3db","utf8":"<!-- ex 484 cont -->\nа) $\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{25}}$；　б) $\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{2}{27}}$；　в) $\\sqrt[3]{1\\frac{3}{5}}$；　г) $\\sqrt[4]{5\\frac{1}{3}}$；\nд) $\\sqrt{\\frac{a^2}{3}}$，其中 $a\\geqslant0$；　е) $\\sqrt[4]{\\frac{5}{b^4}}$，其中 $b>0$；\nж) $\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{a^9}{6}}$，其中 $a\\geqslant0$；　з) $\\sqrt[4]{\\frac{7}{b^{12}}}$，其中 $b>0$。\n\n<!-- ex 485 -->\n485. 从根号下面提出因式（字母表示非负数）：\nа) $\\sqrt{4a}$；　б) $\\sqrt{18b}$；　в) $\\sqrt{50x^3}$；　г) $\\sqrt[3]{27y}$；\nд) $\\sqrt[4]{16c}$；　е) $\\sqrt[3]{5a^4}$；　ж) $\\sqrt[4]{81b^6}$；　з) $\\sqrt[6]{10c^8}$。\n\n<!-- ex 486 -->\n486. 把因数移到根号下面：\nа) $2\\sqrt{3}$；　б) $3\\sqrt{2}$；　в) $2\\sqrt[3]{5}$；　г) $5\\sqrt[3]{2}$；\nд) $3\\sqrt[4]{\\frac{1}{9}}$；　е) $2\\sqrt[5]{\\frac{1}{8}}$；　ж) $a\\sqrt[3]{2}$，其中 $a>0$；\nз) $b\\sqrt[4]{5}$，其中 $b>0$。\n\n<!-- ex 487 -->\n487. 把下列各式写成 $a\\sqrt[n]{b}$ 的形式，其中 $a$ 是有理数，$b$ 是\n自然数。\nа) $\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{3}}$；　б) $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}$；　в) $\\frac{2}{\\sqrt[3]{2}}$；　г) $\\frac{15}{\\sqrt[3]{5}}$；\nд) $\\frac{3}{\\sqrt[4]{6}}$；　е) $\\frac{10}{\\sqrt[4]{8}}$。\n\n<!-- ex 488 -->\n488. 化简：\nа) $\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt{2}}$；　б) $\\sqrt[5]{\\sqrt{3}}$；　в) $\\sqrt{\\sqrt[3]{7}}$；　г) $\\sqrt[8]{\\sqrt[4]{12}}$；\nд) $\\sqrt[5]{2\\sqrt{2}}$； е) $\\sqrt[3]{2\\sqrt{5}}$； ж) $\\sqrt{a\\sqrt{a}}$，其中 $a\\geqslant0$；\nз) $\\sqrt[3]{b\\sqrt[3]{b}}$，其中 $b\\geqslant0$；　и) $\\sqrt{c\\sqrt[3]{c^2}}$，其中 $c\\geqslant0$。\n\n<!-- ex 489 -->\n489. 查平方根表计算：\nа) $\\sqrt[4]{18}$；　б) $\\sqrt[4]{1.62}$；　в) $\\sqrt[4]{3.124}$；　г) $\\sqrt[4]{6.25}$。\n\n<!-- foot -->\n156\n"},"beforeFinalize":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26-raw/8a/pages/0163/page.md","bytes":2483,"sha256":"dd111deffd9ff7e351cfa0a38d89ce8064f251cdc746a2354e9e952e86adb50a","utf8":"---\n{\n  \"schema\": \"ld-s10y-lesson/page@3\",\n  \"book\": \"8a\",\n  \"page\": 163,\n  \"printed_page\": 156,\n  \"source\": {\n    \"pdf\": \"8a 苏联十年制学校数学教材 代数 八年级.pdf\",\n    \"pdf_sha256\": \"5978388efc80df4085400f80d5912f710efb052a806222633b172b0a9479b071\",\n    \"pdf_page\": 163\n  },\n  \"render\": {\n    \"dpi\": 300,\n    \"w\": 2480,\n    \"h\": 3509,\n    \"sha256\": \"0357daed5cf73097af3edee9ec653be7625b7cc688dcde7e5ff41e598160b525\"\n  },\n  \"profile\": {\n    \"id\": \"soviet-cn\",\n    \"sha256\": \"dad8d974ba16880482f359073263269de8c405ccf8cb17dc4215fad11da44849\"\n  },\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"Nested radicals, Cyrillic subparts, and printed fraction rows are retained without mathematical revision.\"\n  ],\n  \"errata\": []\n}\n---\n\n<!-- ex 484 cont -->\nа) $\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{25}}$；　б) $\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{2}{27}}$；　в) $\\sqrt[3]{1\\frac{3}{5}}$；　г) $\\sqrt[4]{5\\frac{1}{3}}$；\nд) $\\sqrt{\\frac{a^2}{3}}$，其中 $a\\geqslant0$；　е) $\\sqrt[4]{\\frac{5}{b^4}}$，其中 $b>0$；\nж) $\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{a^9}{6}}$，其中 $a\\geqslant0$；　з) $\\sqrt[4]{\\frac{7}{b^{12}}}$，其中 $b>0$。\n\n<!-- ex 485 -->\n485. 从根号下面提出因式（字母表示非负数）：\nа) $\\sqrt{4a}$；　б) $\\sqrt{18b}$；　в) $\\sqrt{50x^3}$；　г) $\\sqrt[3]{27y}$；\nд) $\\sqrt[4]{16c}$；　е) $\\sqrt[3]{5a^4}$；　ж) $\\sqrt[4]{81b^6}$；　з) $\\sqrt[6]{10c^8}$。\n\n<!-- ex 486 -->\n486. 把因数移到根号下面：\nа) $2\\sqrt{3}$；　б) $3\\sqrt{2}$；　в) $2\\sqrt[3]{5}$；　г) $5\\sqrt[3]{2}$；\nд) $3\\sqrt[4]{\\frac{1}{9}}$；　е) $2\\sqrt[5]{\\frac{1}{8}}$；　ж) $a\\sqrt[3]{2}$，其中 $a>0$；\nз) $b\\sqrt[4]{5}$，其中 $b>0$。\n\n<!-- ex 487 -->\n487. 把下列各式写成 $a\\sqrt[n]{b}$ 的形式，其中 $a$ 是有理数，$b$ 是\n自然数。\nа) $\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{3}}$；　б) $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}$；　в) $\\frac{2}{\\sqrt[3]{2}}$；　г) $\\frac{15}{\\sqrt[3]{5}}$；\nд) $\\frac{3}{\\sqrt[4]{6}}$；　е) $\\frac{10}{\\sqrt[4]{8}}$。\n\n<!-- ex 488 -->\n488. 化简：\nа) $\\sqrt[3]{\\sqrt{2}}$；　б) $\\sqrt[5]{\\sqrt{3}}$；　в) $\\sqrt{\\sqrt[3]{7}}$；　г) $\\sqrt[8]{\\sqrt[4]{12}}$；\nд) $\\sqrt[5]{2\\sqrt{2}}$； е) $\\sqrt[3]{2\\sqrt{5}}$； ж) $\\sqrt{a\\sqrt{a}}$，其中 $a\\geqslant0$；\nз) $\\sqrt[3]{b\\sqrt[3]{b}}$，其中 $b\\geqslant0$；　и) $\\sqrt{c\\sqrt[3]{c^2}}$，其中 $c\\geqslant0$。\n\n<!-- ex 489 -->\n489. 查平方根表计算：\nа) $\\sqrt[4]{18}$；　б) $\\sqrt[4]{1.62}$；　в) $\\sqrt[4]{3.124}$；　г) $\\sqrt[4]{6.25}$。\n\n<!-- foot -->\n156\n"}},{"page":164,"template":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26/8a/pages/0164/page.template.md","bytes":1454,"sha256":"1229519028bff723674b783a1815eff5bda332a1e3aea9ec17055fd5c22d2f1d"},"sourcePagePng":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26/8a/pages/0164/page.png","bytes":810410,"sha256":"40776cc30ad5fdb06ae3195528eac94817d29579d386260debc9dc22592dc1d5"},"sourceGridPng":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26/8a/pages/0164/page.grid.png","bytes":816008,"sha256":"7f57efafc05a1b6de57b86267de43d1a08a7924fc25f04a9d4aa3833041e80dd"},"body":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26-bodies/0164.md","bytes":1668,"sha256":"5971609dab7808c85703f2a795eb8cdc55269d94ba490d3c85c901348a8825b5","utf8":"<!-- ex 490 -->\n490. 化简：\nа) $\\sqrt[4]{5^2}$；　б) $\\sqrt[9]{7^6}$；　в) $\\sqrt[12]{25^3}$；　г) $\\sqrt[18]{36^3}$；\nд) $\\sqrt[3]{5\\sqrt{5}}$； е) $\\sqrt{4\\sqrt[3]{4}}$；　ж) $\\sqrt[4]{x\\sqrt[3]{x}}$，其中 $x\\geqslant0$；\nз) $\\sqrt[5]{a\\sqrt[4]{a}}$，其中 $a\\geqslant0$。\n\n<!-- ex 491 -->\n491. 比较两数的大小：\nа) $\\sqrt[3]{3}$ 和 $\\sqrt[6]{5}$；　б) $\\sqrt{2}$ 和 $\\sqrt[6]{7}$；　в) $\\sqrt[6]{8}$ 和 $\\sqrt{3}$；\nг) $\\sqrt[3]{2}$ 和 $\\sqrt[12]{45}$；　д) $\\sqrt[3]{5}$ 和 $\\sqrt{2\\sqrt[3]{3}}$；\nе) $\\sqrt[3]{7}$ 和 $\\sqrt{3\\sqrt[3]{2}}$。\n\n<!-- ex 492 -->\n492. 确定差的符号：\nа) $\\sqrt{2}-\\sqrt[3]{3}$；　б) $\\sqrt[3]{3}-\\sqrt[4]{4}$；　в) $\\sqrt[4]{4}-\\sqrt[5]{5}$；\nг) $\\sqrt[5]{5}-\\sqrt[6]{6}$。\n\n<!-- ex 493 -->\n493. 求下列各式的值：\nа) $\\sqrt[3]{7+\\sqrt{22}}\\cdot\\sqrt[3]{7-\\sqrt{22}}$； б) $\\sqrt[4]{7-4\\sqrt{3}}\\cdot\\sqrt{2+\\sqrt{3}}$；\nв) $\\sqrt[3]{1+\\sqrt{2}}\\cdot\\sqrt[6]{3-2\\sqrt{2}}$；\nг) $\\sqrt{4-2\\sqrt{2}}\\cdot\\sqrt[4]{6+4\\sqrt{2}}$。\n\n<!-- exhead -->\n复习题\n\n<!-- ex 494 -->\n494. 旅行者乘坐小船沿河顺流行驶 $4$ 公里，再逆流行驶 $3$ 公\n里，在整个路程上所用的时间和他乘坐小船在静水里行\n驶 $10$ 公里所需要的时间相同。已知河水的流速等于\n$3$ 公里/小时，求小船在静水里的速度。\n\n<!-- ex 495 -->\n495. 证明：由公式 $x_n=8-3n$ 给出的数列 $(x_n)$ 是等差数列。\n求数列的第 $1$ 项和公差。\n\n<!-- ex 496 -->\n496. 证明：由公式 $y_n=64\\cdot(\\frac{1}{2})^n$ 给出的数列 $(y_n)$ 是等比数\n列。求数列的第 $1$ 项和公比。\n\n<!-- foot -->\n157\n"},"beforeFinalize":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26-raw/8a/pages/0164/page.md","bytes":2390,"sha256":"25cf078755c5966fdc58d4a612fc04761277f7446a4c072234274e32951c04ee","utf8":"---\n{\n  \"schema\": \"ld-s10y-lesson/page@3\",\n  \"book\": \"8a\",\n  \"page\": 164,\n  \"printed_page\": 157,\n  \"source\": {\n    \"pdf\": \"8a 苏联十年制学校数学教材 代数 八年级.pdf\",\n    \"pdf_sha256\": \"5978388efc80df4085400f80d5912f710efb052a806222633b172b0a9479b071\",\n    \"pdf_page\": 164\n  },\n  \"render\": {\n    \"dpi\": 300,\n    \"w\": 2480,\n    \"h\": 3509,\n    \"sha256\": \"40776cc30ad5fdb06ae3195528eac94817d29579d386260debc9dc22592dc1d5\"\n  },\n  \"profile\": {\n    \"id\": \"soviet-cn\",\n    \"sha256\": \"dad8d974ba16880482f359073263269de8c405ccf8cb17dc4215fad11da44849\"\n  },\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"Exercise 493 retains the different printed radical indices of its factors; no mathematical correction was made.\"\n  ],\n  \"errata\": []\n}\n---\n\n<!-- ex 490 -->\n490. 化简：\nа) $\\sqrt[4]{5^2}$；　б) $\\sqrt[9]{7^6}$；　в) $\\sqrt[12]{25^3}$；　г) $\\sqrt[18]{36^3}$；\nд) $\\sqrt[3]{5\\sqrt{5}}$； е) $\\sqrt{4\\sqrt[3]{4}}$；　ж) $\\sqrt[4]{x\\sqrt[3]{x}}$，其中 $x\\geqslant0$；\nз) $\\sqrt[5]{a\\sqrt[4]{a}}$，其中 $a\\geqslant0$。\n\n<!-- ex 491 -->\n491. 比较两数的大小：\nа) $\\sqrt[3]{3}$ 和 $\\sqrt[6]{5}$；　б) $\\sqrt{2}$ 和 $\\sqrt[6]{7}$；　в) $\\sqrt[6]{8}$ 和 $\\sqrt{3}$；\nг) $\\sqrt[3]{2}$ 和 $\\sqrt[12]{45}$；　д) $\\sqrt[3]{5}$ 和 $\\sqrt{2\\sqrt[3]{3}}$；\nе) $\\sqrt[3]{7}$ 和 $\\sqrt{3\\sqrt[3]{2}}$。\n\n<!-- ex 492 -->\n492. 确定差的符号：\nа) $\\sqrt{2}-\\sqrt[3]{3}$；　б) $\\sqrt[3]{3}-\\sqrt[4]{4}$；　в) $\\sqrt[4]{4}-\\sqrt[5]{5}$；\nг) $\\sqrt[5]{5}-\\sqrt[6]{6}$。\n\n<!-- ex 493 -->\n493. 求下列各式的值：\nа) $\\sqrt[3]{7+\\sqrt{22}}\\cdot\\sqrt[3]{7-\\sqrt{22}}$； б) $\\sqrt[4]{7-4\\sqrt{3}}\\cdot\\sqrt{2+\\sqrt{3}}$；\nв) $\\sqrt[3]{1+\\sqrt{2}}\\cdot\\sqrt[6]{3-2\\sqrt{2}}$；\nг) $\\sqrt{4-2\\sqrt{2}}\\cdot\\sqrt[4]{6+4\\sqrt{2}}$。\n\n<!-- exhead -->\n复习题\n\n<!-- ex 494 -->\n494. 旅行者乘坐小船沿河顺流行驶 $4$ 公里，再逆流行驶 $3$ 公\n里，在整个路程上所用的时间和他乘坐小船在静水里行\n驶 $10$ 公里所需要的时间相同。已知河水的流速等于\n$3$ 公里/小时，求小船在静水里的速度。\n\n<!-- ex 495 -->\n495. 证明：由公式 $x_n=8-3n$ 给出的数列 $(x_n)$ 是等差数列。\n求数列的第 $1$ 项和公差。\n\n<!-- ex 496 -->\n496. 证明：由公式 $y_n=64\\cdot(\\frac{1}{2})^n$ 给出的数列 $(y_n)$ 是等比数\n列。求数列的第 $1$ 项和公比。\n\n<!-- foot -->\n157\n"}},{"page":165,"template":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26/8a/pages/0165/page.template.md","bytes":1454,"sha256":"a1003039370d52b302f93b33df29db59a9515434b84c82e7ac91b3caa88f7fc6"},"sourcePagePng":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26/8a/pages/0165/page.png","bytes":888219,"sha256":"981296d89e223f8367d7c3f530833a9f6b1c50939de7916d98be94bd3f4a2ca4"},"sourceGridPng":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26/8a/pages/0165/page.grid.png","bytes":899190,"sha256":"748ce43b9f54f9c7ea55af580710e64af0a008b3b6f3509f8e6d0145f664d5ca"},"body":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26-bodies/0165.md","bytes":1143,"sha256":"56bc2ec1973b713fc961d0785f24f096640f439736563a0ca2b6a523f7b06d82","utf8":"<!-- ex 497 -->\n497. 数列 $(a_n)$ 由公式 $a_n=\\sqrt{n^2+5n}$ 给出。$6$、$-6$、和 $5$ 是这\n个数列的项吗？\n\n<!-- h2 -->\n§10. 有理指数幂\n\n<!-- h3 -->\n27. 函数 $y=a^x(x\\in Z)$ 和它的性质\n\n<!-- p -->\n公式 $y=a^x$ 给出一个函数，其中 $a$ 是不等于零的某一个\n数，$x$ 是取整数值的变量。\n\n<!-- p -->\n这个函数的性质决定于底数 $a$ 是什么数。我们讨论四种\n情形：$a>1,0<a<1,a=1,a<0$。\n\n<!-- p -->\n1. 设 $a>1$，例如 $a=\\frac{4}{3}$。于是，函数由公式 $y=(\\frac{4}{3})^x$ 给出。\n我们将自变量和函数的对应值列表，并且用小数点后保留两\n位的小数表示 $y$ 值：\n\n<!-- fig 表 box 280,1840,1750,285 -->\n\n<!-- p -->\n在坐标平面上，描出上表\n中列出坐标的点。函数的图象\n（图 $65$）由横坐标是整数的单\n个的点组成。\n\n<!-- fig 图 65 box 1190,2160,800,835 -->\n\n<!-- p open -->\n2. 设 $0<a<1$，例如，$a↵=\\frac{2}{3}$。函数由公式 $y=(\\frac{2}{3})^x$\n给出。我们将自变量和函数的\n对应值列表，也用小数点后保\n\n<!-- cap 图 65 samerow -->\n图 $65$\n\n<!-- foot -->\n158\n"},"beforeFinalize":{"path":"/Users/yong/.codex/worktrees/stemrobin-182-six-8108/lemmadeck/.tmp/ld-s10y-lesson/resume182-6-8108/source-N26-raw/8a/pages/0165/page.md","bytes":2166,"sha256":"790be0da7ab5d2cd83db4991608470b8c36ee3fc0d373bef23a0010b1642d315","utf8":"---\n{\n  \"schema\": \"ld-s10y-lesson/page@3\",\n  \"book\": \"8a\",\n  \"page\": 165,\n  \"printed_page\": 158,\n  \"source\": {\n    \"pdf\": \"8a 苏联十年制学校数学教材 代数 八年级.pdf\",\n    \"pdf_sha256\": \"5978388efc80df4085400f80d5912f710efb052a806222633b172b0a9479b071\",\n    \"pdf_page\": 165\n  },\n  \"render\": {\n    \"dpi\": 300,\n    \"w\": 2480,\n    \"h\": 3509,\n    \"sha256\": \"981296d89e223f8367d7c3f530833a9f6b1c50939de7916d98be94bd3f4a2ca4\"\n  },\n  \"profile\": {\n    \"id\": \"soviet-cn\",\n    \"sha256\": \"dad8d974ba16880482f359073263269de8c405ccf8cb17dc4215fad11da44849\"\n  },\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"N26 ends with exercise 497; everything after the section/topic headings belongs to the incomplete N27 boundary, not to N26.\",\n    \"The unnumbered table and figure 65 are N27 prose figures. Table/figure interior print is retained by figure boxes; the printed caption is a separate samerow block.\",\n    \"The case-2 a = 2/3 formula wraps after a in the source; one actual wrap marker preserves the two printed rows.\"\n  ],\n  \"errata\": []\n}\n---\n\n<!-- ex 497 -->\n497. 数列 $(a_n)$ 由公式 $a_n=\\sqrt{n^2+5n}$ 给出。$6$、$-6$、和 $5$ 是这\n个数列的项吗？\n\n<!-- h2 -->\n§10. 有理指数幂\n\n<!-- h3 -->\n27. 函数 $y=a^x(x\\in Z)$ 和它的性质\n\n<!-- p -->\n公式 $y=a^x$ 给出一个函数，其中 $a$ 是不等于零的某一个\n数，$x$ 是取整数值的变量。\n\n<!-- p -->\n这个函数的性质决定于底数 $a$ 是什么数。我们讨论四种\n情形：$a>1,0<a<1,a=1,a<0$。\n\n<!-- p -->\n1. 设 $a>1$，例如 $a=\\frac{4}{3}$。于是，函数由公式 $y=(\\frac{4}{3})^x$ 给出。\n我们将自变量和函数的对应值列表，并且用小数点后保留两\n位的小数表示 $y$ 值：\n\n<!-- fig 表 box 280,1840,1750,285 -->\n\n<!-- p -->\n在坐标平面上，描出上表\n中列出坐标的点。函数的图象\n（图 $65$）由横坐标是整数的单\n个的点组成。\n\n<!-- fig 图 65 box 1190,2160,800,835 -->\n\n<!-- p open -->\n2. 设 $0<a<1$，例如，$a↵=\\frac{2}{3}$。函数由公式 $y=(\\frac{2}{3})^x$\n给出。我们将自变量和函数的\n对应值列表，也用小数点后保\n\n<!-- cap 图 65 samerow -->\n图 $65$\n\n<!-- foot -->\n158\n"}}],"callsAtComposition":{"prepare":0,"finalize":0,"paid":0,"assemble":0,"adapt":0,"db":0},"monetaryCost":"UNKNOWN"}
